# Of all the mammals on Earth, by weight, what share is wild?
subtitle: "Weigh every mammal on Earth and guess the wild slice, then meet the dogs, pigs and chickens that outweigh whole kingdoms of wildlife."
tags: ["biology","earth","data"]
format: quiz
thumb: "band \"Weigh every mammal on Earth\" note \"How much is wild?\""
voices: {"a":"gemini:Iapetus | a clear, curious quiz host; plain and friendly","b":"gemini:Puck | a curious co-host guessing out loud; relaxed and good-humoured, never exaggerated","take":"lines"}

## Of all the mammals on Earth, by weight, what share is wild?
use: pie_chart
with:
    labels:
      - Us + our animals
      - Wild
    values:
      - 95
      - 5
    percent: false
    label_size: 30
    box:
      x: 10
      'y': 180
      w: 600
      h: 460
sources:
    - id: owid
      title: Almost all of the world's mammal biomass is humans and livestock
      authors: Hannah Ritchie and Fiona Spooner (Our World in Data)
      year: 2025
      url: https://ourworldindata.org/wild-mammals-birds-biomass
      finding: of all mammal biomass, humans are 36 %, livestock and pets 59 %, wild land mammals 2 % and wild marine mammals 3 %; humans outweigh all wild mammals more than seven times; all dogs weigh as much as all wild land mammals; farmed pigs weigh as much as all marine mammals; poultry are 71 % of all bird biomass, wild birds 29 %
    - id: greenspoon
      title: The global biomass of wild mammals
      authors: Lior Greenspoon, Eyal Krieger, Ron Sender, Yuval Rosenberg, Yinon M. Bar-On, Uri Moran, Tomer Antman, Shai Meiri, Uri Roll, Elad Noor, Ron Milo
      year: 2023
      finding: the study behind the shares

    card title "How much of mammal-kind is wild?"

A: Put every mammal on Earth on one giant scale: cows, people, whales, mice. How much of the weight is wild?
    icon o_cow size 240 set twemoji x 220 y 450 icon_look picture of "cow face"
    icon o_hum size 240 set twemoji x 500 y 450 icon_look picture of "person standing"
    icon o_wh size 240 set twemoji x 780 y 450 icon_look picture of "spouting whale"

B: Whales, elephants, all those deer? Half, at least.
    highlight o_wh

    erase o_cow o_hum o_wh

    ask "Drag the edge of the wild slice to your guess." on slice_2 store g default "50"
        right: Right: about five percent. Elephants, whales, deer and mice, all of them together.
        wrong: It is only about five percent, and that counts every whale.

B: Five percent? Every wild mammal on the planet?
    text p5 "Wild: 5 %" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 790 y 590 font_size 64

A: Every one. Humans alone are thirty-six percent, seven times all the wild mammals together.
    icon hum size 100 set twemoji x 640 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing"
    text p36 "Humans 36%" #2f6b8f cites ["owid"] x 835 y 495 font_size 44
    text x7 "= 7 × all wild" #2f6b8f cites ["owid"] x 835 y 440 font_size 40

A: The rest is our farm animals and pets, mostly cattle: fifty-nine percent.
    icon cow size 100 set twemoji x 640 y 320 icon_look picture of "cow face"
    text p59 "Livestock 59%" #5e584e cites ["owid"] x 835 y 320 font_size 42

B: So the wild ones lost a tug of war with cows.
    highlight slice_1

    erase hum p36 x7 cow p59

A: It gets stranger. All the world's dogs weigh about as much as every wild mammal on land.
    icon dog size 120 set twemoji x 640 y 460 icon_look picture of "dog face"
    text dog_l "= wild on land" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 835 y 460 font_size 38

B: Let me guess. Pigs against whales?
    icon pig size 120 set twemoji x 640 y 310 icon_look picture of "pig face"
    text pig_q "= ?" #b5482e x 820 y 310 font_size 60

    erase pig_q

A: Right. Farmed pigs weigh about as much as all the whales, seals and dolphins in the sea.
    text pig_l "= wild in sea" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 835 y 310 font_size 38

    erase dog dog_l pig pig_l

B: Birds, then. Birds must still be wild.
    icon hen size 140 set twemoji x 640 y 400 icon_look picture of chicken

A: Not by weight. Chickens and other poultry weigh more than twice all the wild birds put together.
    text hen_l "poultry 71%" #b5482e cites ["owid"] x 835 y 430 font_size 46
    text hen_l2 "of bird weight" #5e584e cites ["owid"] x 835 y 370 font_size 38

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    shape pie #b5482e shape circle x 330 y 450 radius 190 style.fill #e9c4b8 hidden true
    text q "?" #2f2b26 x 330 y 450 font_size 220 hidden true
    icon w size 200 set twemoji x 760 y 420 icon_look picture of elephant hidden true
    text l "wild?" #b5482e x 760 y 610 font_size 90 hidden true
    thumb band "Weigh every mammal on Earth" kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    icon cow size 220 set twemoji x 180 y 470 icon_look picture of "cow face" hidden true
    icon hu size 220 set twemoji x 440 y 470 icon_look picture of "person standing" hidden true
    icon el size 220 set twemoji x 700 y 470 icon_look picture of elephant hidden true
    text q "?" #b5482e x 880 y 470 font_size 150 hidden true
    thumb band "Who outweighs whom?" kind band hidden true

## Thumbnail
role: thumbnail

    text t "All the world's dogs" #2f2b26 x 470 y 630 font_size 80 hidden true
    icon dog size 260 set twemoji x 330 y 420 icon_look picture of "dog face" hidden true
    text eq "= ?" #b5482e x 680 y 420 font_size 180 hidden true
    thumb band "Your dog's heavy secret" kind band hidden true
